# Symphony is a protocol, not an app - almost nothing should be ignored.
# Keep tickets, MEMORY.md and ticketorder.md tracked: they ARE the state.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Vendor-specific mirrors are conveniences, never sources of truth.
# Track them if you use them; they must never hold protocol content.

# Project worktrees live beside Symphony but belong to their own repositories.
/*-folder/
/agitated-curie/
/cipher-board-game/
/whatdate-portal/
/whatdate.app_portal/

# This root is the Symphony protocol repository, not a general Documents workspace.
# New shared assets must be explicitly allowlisted below before they can be committed.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/Agent role.md
!/orchestrator model map.md
!/taskagent.md
!/.agent_profiles/
!/.agent_profiles/**
!/skills/
!/skills/**
!/project1/
!/project1/**
!/project2/
!/project2/**
